WEBVTT

00:01:30.128 --> 00:01:31.754
On the other side of a dilemma,

00:01:31.754 --> 00:01:34.507
there is a dynamic
and unpredictable value,

00:01:34.549 --> 00:01:36.884
like an organization's shifting culture,

00:01:36.884 --> 00:01:39.679
environmental impact or new technologies.

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:41.722
We call this value the river.

00:01:42.014 --> 00:01:44.183
Less tangible, more fluid,

00:01:44.225 --> 00:01:47.395
but essential to navigate
for long-term success and survival.

00:01:47.895 --> 00:01:49.772
To unlock progress in dilemmas,

00:01:49.814 --> 00:01:52.525
we need to stop holding
these values in opposition

00:01:52.525 --> 00:01:55.278
and bring them together
in a space of listening,

00:01:55.278 --> 00:01:57.822
creative exploration and cooperation.

00:01:59.115 --> 00:02:03.494
We can combine the best of both worlds
in what we call the resolution zone,